# One denylisted identifier per line (case-insensitive substring match
# against every tracked file). Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# `token>>filename` denylists `token` everywhere EXCEPT that exact tracked
# filename — a known, intentional exception (e.g. the repo owner's own name
# as LICENSE copyright holder), not a leak.
SYNTHETIC_IDENTIFIER_ONE
SYNTHETIC_IDENTIFIER_TWO
SYNTHETIC_IDENTIFIER_TWO>>LICENSE
